WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:50.220
Someone once said...

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:55.220
There are chrysanthemums with 
petals of crunchy crackers...

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:59.090
Chrysanthecrackers!

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:07.400
There are ginkgo nuts crammed 
full of sweet red bean paste...

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:11.340
Ginredbean Pastenuts!

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:15.640
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:21.820
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:29.020
Toriko-san, wait up!

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:31.220
I can't walk anymore!

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:34.030
Yeesh. Even after seeing that?

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:36.500
Seeing what?

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.470
What are you talking about?

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.470
The mountain that's overflowing 
with fall taste sensations...

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:48.070
Autumn Mountain!

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.880
Assemble on Autumn Mountain!

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:58.080
Terry, Yun, Kiss, Queen!

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:04.060
But that mountain is gigantic...

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:06.530
It's as big as the Mors Mountains!

00:03:06.530 --> 00:03:09.090
Actually, bigger than 
the Mors Mountain Range.

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:11.460
It's about 20,000 kilometers long.

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:13.130
20,000 kilometers?!

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:15.330
The incredible length of this mountain range

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.100
has also had an effect on 
the prevailing westerlies,

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.140
making the fall season extremely long.

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:22.140
The long, slow ripening process is extended,

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:25.380
making the autumn ingredients 
grow even more deliciously.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:28.110
Other than that, this has 
apparently been a fruitful year,

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:30.650
with a bigger bumper crop than ever.

00:03:30.650 --> 00:03:34.350
It sounds like what we heard at the 
Gourmet Shrine was right on the money.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.550
According to my supplier,

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:40.460
the legendary pears on 
Autumn Mountain are ripe!

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:43.030
Legendary pears... Supears!

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:44.730
And I guess they really exist, Toriko-san!

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:48.030
Yep. Like they say, "It often 
takes time to bear fruit."

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:50.670
And Supears supposedly take 38 years

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:53.040
to get to a fully ripened state.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:58.080
If you bite into one, the fresh juice 
splashes dozens of meters in the air!

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:00.680
It's like it bursts open!

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:02.510
Dang, I wanna try eatin' one!

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:06.450
But I have a feeling it'll be tough 
looking for them on that huge mountain.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.050
Yeah, well...

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:11.450
Rumor has it the pears originally 
came from the Gourmet World,

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:14.620
so you can imagine having 
a hard time getting 'em,

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:15.660
but it'll be okay.

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:21.230
Terry?!

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.070
Don't scare me!

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:26.340
Whoa!

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:28.700
Terry is a Battle Wolf

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:31.570
with an exceptional sense of 
smell and most importantly,

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:33.540
a love for Gourmet World food.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.210
There's no doubt he'll be able 
to catch the Supear scent.

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:38.080
At any rate, Terry,

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:40.080
you get bigger every time I see you!

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:47.320
We've arrived at Autumn Mountain!

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:50.430
You're really excited, huh?

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:53.130
Despite moaning about not being able 
to walk just a couple minutes ago...

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:57.070
Well, seeing these red leaves 
would lift anybody's spirits!

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:58.630
Of course, there's capturing the Supears,

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:01.570
but also mushroom-gathering, 
grape-picking, leaf-viewing...

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:04.070
I'm going to get my fill of autumn today!

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:07.180
There's a grape tree already!

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.580
There's a ton of them, Toriko-san!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:10.850
Hey, wait a second!

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.050
What's wrong?!

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:21.190
Dancing Grapes (Plant Beast) Capture Level 30

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:24.020
W-W-What is this?!

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:33.470
Beast Plants that move like 
they're dancing to capture prey.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:34.900
Dancing Grapes.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.570
Moving plants?!

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.070
Nothin' unusual about that.

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:41.940
There were some in the Wu Jungle 
when we got the BB Corn.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.380
Yeah, but...

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:45.750
Looks like this is gonna 
be a thrilling flavor hunt.

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:47.510
"Hunt", you say...

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:50.820
I was thinking more along 
the lines of "gathering"...

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:54.250
Now that's obviously a dangerous beastie...

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:58.320
A Beast that's in the middle of stockpiling 
ingredients for hibernation...

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:04.660
In other words, we have to be careful 
of more than just moving grapes, huh?

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:22.550
This isn't the image I had 
of mushroom-gathering!

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:24.550
Mushrooms aren't supposed to run!

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.450
Mushrooms that trot away...

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:28.090
Trotrooms.

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:30.190
After all, mushrooms are 
a kind of slime mold.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.260
So it's no surprise that they run around.

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:33.260
I'll get it this time!

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:35.060
Alright!

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:39.560
Ow...

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:45.170
What?! What?! What?! What?!

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:47.910
Whoa, whoa, wait!

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:51.640
Yeesh...

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:55.110
Spiked Punch!

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:01.620
You okay, Komatsu?!

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:04.120
Yes! But what was that about?!

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:06.260
That's a Stinging Maple.

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:08.630
It hits you in the back 
'til you turn bright red.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:13.100
What kind of attack is that, 
like a childish prank?!

00:07:13.100 --> 00:07:15.570
It stings like heck!

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:20.100
Uh-oh! Peabees!

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:22.070
Now what?!

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:26.510
Peabea (Insect Beast) Capture Level 25

00:07:22.070 --> 00:07:24.770
Peabees have a poison needle!

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:27.980
It's a thousand times more poisonous 
than the poisonous mushroom, Poisroom!

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.580
An average human will die instantly 
if they get pricked with it!

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:32.480
Run!

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:37.050
Their type of poison differs, 
depending on the individual!

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:40.490
It's possible that even I don't 
have the antibody against them!

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:42.290
Pains in the neck!

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.000
Comin' your way, Komatsu!

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.530
Gimme a break!

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:58.740
Poison Dressing!

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:10.220
I weakened the poison, so you'll 
be able to move again soon.

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:11.650
Coco-san!

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:13.990
Hi, Komatsu. Toriko.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.490
Long time no see.

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:20.830
Kiss has gotten huge!

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:23.230
So how's your training going?

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:26.130
Smoothly. Looks like it's the same for you.

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:29.500
My Gourmet Cells are 
activating more than before.

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:32.140
What can I say? You're 
going after Supears, too?

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:33.010
Yeah.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:34.640
Although according to my fortune,

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:38.580
we're not the only ones who 
have come to pick Supears.

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:44.350
Queen-chan! Then Sonny-san is here, too!

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:49.090
Coco! You made another beautiful entrance?!

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:52.090
It ticks me off to no end when 
you steal my beautiful thunder!

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:53.460
Same old Sunny...

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.530
It's okay, Terry.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:03.200
The Battle Wolf.

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:04.840
Gotten bigger, I see.

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:05.440
Whoop!

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:11.740
I've come to capture a few Supears so 
beautiful Queen could get some exercise.

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:15.850
You're all after the same... Well, 
I don't think I need to ask that.

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:17.550
Supears really are special!

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:20.090
For Coco-san and Sunny-san 
to go after them, too...!

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:22.990
Well, why don't we split up and search?

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:25.990
Wait, since we're here 
to hunt for a fall taste,

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:27.390
why not make it more fun?

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:32.060
Let's make it a contest to see which 
party finds the Supears first.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:32.670
Well?

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:34.970
What do you mean, "party"?

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:37.500
Each person and their partner.

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:39.810
Toriko and the Battle Wolf...

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.110
Coco and Kiss...

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:44.680
Queen and I, and finally...

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.010
Matsu and the Wall Penguin.

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:48.850
Us too?!

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:52.450
What do you think?! 
Beautiful idea, isn't it?!

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:53.820
It does sound fun.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.890
And I haven't played much with Kiss lately...

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:59.190
I could go along with it...

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:00.390
Right, Terry?

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.490
I think we'll sit this one out...

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:03.860
Then it's settled!

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:06.460
Um, did you hear what I said?!

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:08.230
Alright, then let's get started!

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.330
That's no fair!

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:12.040
Kiss!

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:17.710
We better get a move on too, Terry!

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.380
Don't leave us here!

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:25.050
Terry! Terry! Terry! Terry! Please, 
let me ride on your back, too!

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:26.420
Please!

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:49.670
It's impossible to get a full view 
of the mountain from the ground.

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:51.870
Like they say, "You can't see 
the forest for the trees."

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:55.040
So it's advantageous to have 
a literal bird's-eye view.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:58.310
There are slightly more autumnal 
leaves over to the north.

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:00.280
Kiss, let's head over there.

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:06.460
I bet Toriko thinks it'll be easy

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:09.960
for the Battle Wolf to find 
a Gourmet World ingredient,

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:12.930
but Queen is from the Gourmet World, too.

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:15.930
Queen's tongue can sense 
the smell of anything.

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:18.100
She can catch a scent as 
well as some Battle Wolf.

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:20.400
Let's go, Queen!

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:23.840
Queen! Queen! Queen!

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:25.810
But this mountain

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:29.110
is full of creatures with 
really high Capture Levels...

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.950
An exceptionally sweet scent.

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:34.150
That's what you're looking for, Terry.

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:37.520
Let's stick like glue to 
Toriko-san and Terry-san.

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.050
If we lose them, it's all over.

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:44.090
Chestnut Rice Balls!

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:47.030
Chestnuts that taste like 
newly harvested rice balls!

00:11:47.030 --> 00:11:49.660
Chestnut Rice Balls are the best!

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:52.800
This is the kind of autumn 
taste I'm looking for!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:58.340
This is a big one, Yun!

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:02.040
Walking along like this 
makes me think back...

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:04.550
...on that trip.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:09.820
You've gotten big too, y'know?

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.390
What, are you marking territory?!

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:18.730
That marking has a little too much impact...

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:19.730
Toriko-san!

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:22.760
Thank goodness! I almost lost you!

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:25.870
I only found you because 
I heard you yelling...

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.300
Thanks to that...?

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:30.140
Anyway, it saved me.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.640
The path disappears when 
the plants move, see...

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:33.610
The path?

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:36.740
Then Terry's marking comes in handy.

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:40.010
If we follow the smell of his marking,

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:42.310
we can get back to where we 
started without getting lost.

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:45.080
As always, nice piss!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:47.050
"Nice piss"...

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:50.460
What is it, Terry?!

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:53.830
Don't tell me...

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:03.400
Mutton Boars (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 33

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:02.030
These guys are Mutton Boars!

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:13.040
Whoa! I didn't know Mutton 
Boars were this fast!

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.180
Can't be helped then...

00:13:16.180 --> 00:13:19.520
Flying Knife!

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:21.750
Wha...?! I hit it!

00:13:35.030 --> 00:13:36.600
Toriko-san!

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:40.200
Help!

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:41.440
Komatsu!

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:46.140
I can't catch up!

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:49.010
Terry!

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:51.720
You want me to get on?

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:55.820
Alright!

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:58.420
I'm countin' on you, Terry!

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:06.330
This is Terry's Battle Wolf power?!

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:08.200
What speed!

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:12.070
Komatsu!

00:14:30.850 --> 00:14:33.020
Terry, charge!

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:36.860
Komatsu!

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:43.500
Where'd they go?!

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:44.130
Toriko!

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:47.040
What is it? Did something happen?

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.500
Komatsu was kidnapped by a Mutton Boar!

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:50.340
What?!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.550
They're up there?!

00:14:58.180 --> 00:15:04.090
But the seasonal autumn wind is 
supposed to be a mighty gale.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.750
Going to the peak would 
be dangerous, wouldn't it?

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:14.500
That guy is so reckless!

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:27.310
Bring him back, Toriko and Terry!

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:33.080
800 meters! This is as high as we can get!

00:15:33.650 --> 00:15:35.250
Thanks!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.950
There it is!

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:51.260
Nice, Terry!

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:58.370
Alright, give me back Komatsu.

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:00.270
W-Wait!

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:06.110
Hey, what the...?!

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:09.580
It looks like the Mutton Boar family.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:20.760
I was covered up by the fur, so 
I didn't realize it at first,

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:25.060
but they're thin as rails...

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:25.900
Now that you mention it...

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:29.170
...their electromagnetic waves are also weak.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:30.130
They're starving.

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:34.940
Even though there are plenty of 
ingredients on the mountain this year...

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:36.040
I see...

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:39.440
So the Beasts that grew quickly as a result

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:41.910
were only the ones with high Capture Levels.

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:45.280
Then the other Beasts had 
to scramble for food,

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:48.890
but weren't able to get 
enough to feed their young.

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:51.090
I'll give them my Chestnut Rice Balls,

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:53.420
but it won't be enough...

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:56.630
Terry!

00:16:57.890 --> 00:16:59.560
Have you...?

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:02.630
Yes. You can see it from up here.

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:05.700
The leaves are reddest in this area.

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:08.670
And Queen senses a sweet aroma here.

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:11.210
Then maybe that means

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:13.040
the Supears are

00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:15.010
in these clouds?!

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:55.380
Those are...

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:56.480
...Supears!

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:05.690
I wonder why the Mutton Boars 
didn't notice the pears...

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.830
No wonder, really.

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:10.600
For one thing, the view 
is obstructed by clouds

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:12.630
and they're translucent.

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:16.340
But more than that, their scent is faint.

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:21.040
It even took Terry and Queen 
all this time to pick it up.

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:24.910
It takes time for Supears to ripen.

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:28.020
Hence they grow secretly, 
so as not to be found.

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:32.550
Now that's a hefty fruit!

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:35.260
It's as heavy as a watermelon.

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:39.390
Bubbles are dancing inside 
the fruit. Beautiful!

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:39.990
Here you go.

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:44.630
Alright, let's all eat our fill!

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:49.370
We give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:18:50.470 --> 00:18:52.270
Let's eat!

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:09.620
The juice is gushing out!

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.420
And like soda water,

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:14.560
sweet fruit juice is jumping 
around in my mouth!

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:17.160
Pear, persimmon, chestnut...

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.870
The sweet fruity flavors of fall

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:23.070
are bursting through one after another!

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:26.840
I see! These clouds!

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:29.110
They're made from a 
gathering of all the vapor

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:32.040
coming off of the mountain's autumn flavors!

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:34.080
That accounts for the Supear's taste!

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:37.820
The juice is overflowing... 
and it doesn't stop!

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:40.750
What a refined and refreshing sweetness!

00:19:40.750 --> 00:19:43.120
It's so fresh and juicy!

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:51.030
Delicious!

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:01.040
This time, Terry discovered it first,

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:03.570
so Terry and Toriko win.

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:07.080
Nah, the real winners are that family.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:10.250
With a harvest like this, starvation 
shouldn't be a problem.

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:12.720
That's thanks to Terry, too.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:20.920
Hey...

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:23.690
The old man's ingredients...

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:25.860
How about havin' another go at it?

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:27.200
You mean...

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:28.970
That Full Course?

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:29.830
Yeah.

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:36.760
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:40.370
It's time for Gourmet Fortune, with 
a heaping helping of accuracy!

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:45.110
We're going to use a camera this 
week too, so get yours ready!

00:21:45.440 --> 00:21:48.510
Okay, please choose one 
of these three platters.

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:53.180
This week's lucky ingredient 
is in one of them!

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:57.150
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:59.520
Alright, here we go!

00:22:00.050 --> 00:22:02.590
A heaping helping...

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:05.020
Open!

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:09.060
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:16.200
C - Tundra Dragon Capture Level 55

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.960
...yours if you chose C!

00:22:11.960 --> 00:22:14.100
If you go out wearing your favorite clothes,

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:16.100
you might just make a new acquaintance!

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:23.910
A - Rock Drum Capture Level 27

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:20.540
If you chose A, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:20.540 --> 00:22:22.740
If you keep your room tidy and in order,

00:22:22.740 --> 00:22:23.840
something good may happen!

00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:32.420
B - White Apple Capture Level <1

00:22:24.710 --> 00:22:27.610
And I'm sorry. If you chose B, you're third.

00:22:27.910 --> 00:22:29.320
Be careful about losing things!

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:32.080
Do a heaping helping of checking 
to make sure you've got everything.

00:22:32.650 --> 00:22:36.050
And finally, it's Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:36.050 --> 00:22:37.720
Are you ready?

00:22:37.260 --> 00:22:43.160
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:37.720 --> 00:22:39.860
If you take a photo of the scene,

00:22:39.860 --> 00:22:43.400
and carry it with you for a week as a 
good luck charm, you'll be even luckier!

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:44.960
Alright, here we go!

00:22:45.230 --> 00:22:47.900
3... 2... 1...

00:22:47.900 --> 00:22:49.300
Scoop Chance!

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:53.240
Complaints, dissatisfaction, 
a venomous tongue...

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:55.470
Go easy on it.

00:22:56.670 --> 00:22:58.710
The wise words of a fortune teller!

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:00.410
They heaping helping hit home!

00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:03.080
I promise not to grumble to the chief.

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:04.450
This week, anyway...

00:23:07.020 --> 00:23:10.840
Toriko and Coco set out to prepare President Ichiryu's full course.

00:23:11.220 --> 00:23:14.160
And Komatsu encounters an old friend from when he was training.

00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:16.790
Reunion! Take-chan of Fairytale Castle!

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:18.920
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
